// Title: Abusable DLL Potential Sideloading From Suspicious Location
// Rule ID: 799a5f48-0ac1-4e0f-9152-71d137d48c2a
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
